caption: Personal Instance
tradition-component: personal-instance

When Revelator is taken, choose exactly two different legal 5-point Psi Power Talents. These are the Revelator Talents and are fixed parts of the personal instance. They may be Power Talents the character already possesses as Basic or secondary Psi Talents or newly selected legal Psi Power Talents.

A Revelator Talent no longer counts against the character's Will/5 limit on secondary Psi Power Talents. Each Revelator Talent may be purchased up to level 4 through Revelator even before Mastery.

Before Mastery, each Revelator Talent grants only Basic purchase access to abilities belonging solely to that Power. For the caps of an ordinary single-branch Basic ability, treat its Revelator Talent as no higher than 2 even if the purchased Talent is higher. This preserves the normal Basic Psi ceiling while allowing the full purchased Talent to govern Revelator conjunctions and Mastery requirements.
